"About the game": "关于游戏",
"Night Stocktake is a co-op horror game about the worst night shift in retail. Clock in with up to three friends, grab a scanner and a cart, and count everything in a hypermarket that will not hold still: lights flicker, shelves rearrange, departments swap places the moment nobody is watching. Your tablet map is a snapshot that goes stale.": "Night Stocktake 是一款关于零售业最糟糕夜班的合作恐怖游戏。与最多三位好友一起打卡上班，拿起扫码枪和购物车，在一家不肯安分的大型超市里清点一切：只要没人看着，灯光就会闪烁，货架会重排，各个区域会互换位置。你平板上的地图只是一张会过时的快照。",
"Six things work the night with you - mannequins that move only when unseen, a book that bites, a shopper you must not scan near, a forklift that never brakes, a cashier who scans whoever stands in her lane and a guard who checks badges. Meet the quota, clock out at six, and spend your wage on perk cards, stickers, heads, hats and scanner skins.": "有六样东西和你一起上夜班——只在无人注视时移动的假人、会咬人的书、绝不能在他附近扫描的购物者、从不刹车的叉车、会扫描站在她通道里任何人的收银员，以及检查工牌的保安。达成指标，六点打卡下班，再把工资花在顾客卡、贴纸、头部、帽子和扫码枪皮肤上。",
